    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common (Requires Attunement by a Wizard)</em></p><p>This cone-shaped hat is adorned with moons and stars. While you are wearing it, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><em><strong>Spellcasting Focus.</strong></em> You can use the hat as a Spellcasting Focus for your Wizard spells.</p><p><em><strong>Unknown Spell.</strong></em> As a Magic action, you can try to cast a cantrip that you don’t know. The cantrip must be on the Wizard spell list and have a casting time of an action, and you make a DC 10 Intelligence (Arcana) check. On a successful check, you cast the spell. On a failed check, the spell fails, and the action used to cast the spell is wasted. In either case, you can’t use this property again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
